  "description": "About Us Slopeland Public School is Co-educational Senior Secondary residential School affiliated to Central Board of Secondary Education (CBSE), New Delhi which is the largest educational board in the country, affiliation No. 1230022. It was founded on 2nd February 2002, with the vision “Education for All”, esp. to help the underprivileged students to get opportunity to get the best education that they can get anywhere in the world. It is a private institution run by Slopeland Public School Trust consisting of eminent educationists and philanthropists, which is running other educational and social institutions as well. Slopeland Public School is the largest educational campus in Manipur, and one of the largest in North East India, situated at a very pollution free eco friendly place, 35 Kms far from maddening and hectic crowd of Imphal City. Historically too, it lies along the foothill of kheba ching where Anglo-Manipuri war were fought and now presently known as Khongjom War Memorial hill which is one of the famous heritage site of the state. Such location makes the Slopeland Plublic School the best location to groom the career of this generation of young people, with the hope of that they are going to make this world a better place. Established in surrounding with finest and excellent infrastructure. 35 acre land pollution free educational friendly green environment It is , that is, School and Hostel blocks as well as Library are fully digitized on par with international standard. e-Campus Biggest and finest residential (boarding) school in North East India. - Nongmaithem Manoj Meitei, scoring 94.2%. Producing CBSE state topper The entire under the latest CBSE curriculum. Classrooms are digitized Smart Class equipped with latest teaching aids, Teacher-Student ratio: - 1:18 (for primary section it is 1:10). , resides along the Imphal-Moreh International Road (Asian Highway-1), with only 45 minutes drive away from maddening crowd of Imphal. Location advantage are available . All the sports facilities are available. Best Sports Facilities coached/trained by highly experienced and qualified Coach/Trainer ,an innovation laboratory for Science,Technology,Engineering, Mathematics , under NITI Aayog , Govt. of India . Established Atal Tinkering Lab Enrichment classes for bright students and remedial classes for weaker students. Rich in co scholastic programme with highly trained instructors in the field of . games & sports, art &culture, dance, traditional art like Thang-Ta Well equipped and highly advanced laboratory, having equipment like of all the subjects, viz. Computer Science, Physics, Biology, Chemistry, Mathematics, Social/Science, Fine & Arts, Language. Space Observatory Telescope, International connection – at the campus as well as international trips for students by signing MoU with foreign countries. conducting classes for foreign languages like Korean The only and the largest with 24 hours round the clock power supply. Wi-Fi Internet enabled campus in the state with more than 50 CCTV cameras installed in the campus and the classroom",
